<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1903455391"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1891334427"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Nameless Love Song"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Guilty Kiss"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Shooting Star Warrior"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:41.160"><div begin="00:34.643" end="04:20.940"><p begin="00:34.643" end="00:41.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">心と心 つながった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心与心 紧密相连</span></p><p begin="00:42.078" end="00:48.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">それだけで 世界生きてく意味がある<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅此而已</span></p><p begin="00:48.942" end="00:52.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">名も無き歌が生まれたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名之歌已然诞生</span></p><p begin="00:52.796" end="00:56.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">愛の雫が落ちる時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当爱的水滴坠落之时</span></p><p begin="00:57.117" end="01:02.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">ときめきが広がってく 波のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悸动如波纹般蔓延荡漾</span></p><p begin="01:02.962" end="01:04.859" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="01:04.859" end="01:06.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="01:06.936" end="01:10.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">なんて綺麗に響くんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何会如此美妙地回响</span></p><p begin="01:10.460" end="01:12.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="01:12.340" end="01:14.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="01:14.557" end="01:18.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">なんで涙が出ちゃいそうなんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何泪水</span></p><p begin="01:18.475" end="01:29.554" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">まっすぐな想いを君へと伝えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这份纯粹思念向你倾诉</span></p><p begin="01:29.554" end="01:31.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Love is all, love is all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即是一切 爱即是一切</span></p><p begin="01:31.353" end="01:37.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">単純なことさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">本就是如此简单</span></p><p begin="01:49.614" end="01:56.607" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">つながったら 願い重なるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若心意相通 祈愿便会重叠</span></p><p begin="01:57.112" end="02:03.672" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">見えない手を握りしめる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握住无形的手</span></p><p begin="02:03.856" end="02:05.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">しっかりつかまえて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牢牢抓紧别放开</span></p><p begin="02:05.603" end="02:09.346" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">どんなに遠くても 一緒に歌おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使相隔天涯也要同声歌唱</span></p><p begin="02:09.346" end="02:10.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">聞こえるよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你定能听见</span></p><p begin="02:10.371" end="02:13.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">世界のどこだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论在世界哪个角落</span></p><p begin="02:14.888" end="02:18.062" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">声が聞こえるよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你定能听见这歌声</span></p><p begin="02:19.003" end="02:22.723" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">名も無き歌が届いたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当无名之歌传递而至</span></p><p begin="02:22.723" end="02:26.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">愛の欠片を受けとって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请收下这爱的碎片</span></p><p begin="02:27.051" end="02:32.722" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">夢を見よう 覚めない夢をいつまでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情编织美梦</span></p><p begin="02:33.018" end="02:34.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="02:34.910" end="02:36.675" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="02:37.057" end="02:40.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">なんて素敵な音なんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是何等动听的旋律</span></p><p begin="02:40.559" end="02:42.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="02:42.448" end="02:44.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="02:44.427" end="02:48.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">なんで言葉が胸に刺さるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何字字句句直刺胸膛</span></p><p begin="02:48.514" end="02:59.513" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">いとしさを今こそ君へと伝えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻将满溢的怜爱向你倾诉</span></p><p begin="02:59.513" end="03:01.379" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Love is all, love is all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即是一切 爱即是一切</span></p><p begin="03:01.379" end="03:07.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">単純なことさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">本就是如此简单</span></p><p begin="03:18.699" end="03:25.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">名も無き歌よ 名も無き愛よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名之歌啊 无名之爱啊</span></p><p begin="03:26.196" end="03:34.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">生きてく意味があると感じるよ... 確かに！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我切实感受到存在的意义</span></p><p begin="03:36.749" end="03:38.665" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="03:38.665" end="03:40.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="03:40.789" end="03:44.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">なんて綺麗に響くんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何会如此美妙地回响</span></p><p begin="03:44.246" end="03:46.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="03:46.135" end="03:47.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Nameless Love Song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名情歌</span></p><p begin="03:48.226" end="03:52.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">なんで涙が出ちゃいそうなんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何泪水</span></p><p begin="03:52.246" end="04:03.212" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">まっすぐな想いを君へと伝えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这份纯粹思念向你倾诉</span></p><p begin="04:03.212" end="04:05.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Love is all, love is all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即是一切 爱即是一切</span></p><p begin="04:05.085" end="04:10.831" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">今こそ伝えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻定要传达予你</span></p><p begin="04:10.831" end="04:12.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Love is all, love is all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即是一切 爱即是一切</span></p><p begin="04:12.578" end="04:20.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">名も無き愛よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无名之爱啊</span></p></div></body></tt>